 "notes": "Claude first pass. Unstable record from -50 on: long jagged sub-baseline complexes with recapture artifacts (spikes to 160-190 inside d5/d15 windows), toco repeatedly clipped at 100 (c19, the -50 plateau, c41). Lates: d2 (gradual 87s under/after the clipped sustained contraction -50..-48, ambiguous but late-morphology), d9 (o2n 90s, +76s), d15 (o2n 81s, +85s). d1 early (shallow smooth sag, nadir at peak). d16 typed prolonged (118s plunge to 78, nearly 2 min). d11 unsure (gentle 41s sag, +62s lag, shape neither clean). Adds: dm42 -23.0..-22.68 (155->90 on c33 peak, gradual down + abrupt overshoot recovery -> variable), dm43 -41.75..-41.35 (sharp V to 87 during c23 plateau -> variable). Sub-threshold sags at -54.0 and -43.0 noted, not annotated.",
